        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Dildarian, Mia Tyler, Cyrinda Foxe\n- TV Series: The Life & Times of Tim\n- Roles: creator, writer, producer, voice actor, actress, model, fashion designer, advertising copywriter\n- Places: New York City\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Dildarian was born on November 3, 1969, and he is an American former advertising copywriter.\n- Mia Abagale Tallarico, better known as Mia Tyler, was born on December 22, 1978, and she is an American actress, model, and fashion designer.\n- Cyrinda Foxe is the mother of Mia Tyler.\n- Steve Dildarian created The Life & Times of Tim.\n- Steve Dildarian was the writer, producer, and voice of Tim in the HBO animated television series The Life & Times of Tim.\n- The Life & Times of Tim ran from 2008 to 2012.\n- The Life & Times of Tim is about Tim, a hapless man in his mid-20s who lives in New York City with his girlfriend Amy.\n- Steve Dildarian voiced the character Tim in The Life & Times of Tim.",
